                                "sense_id": "e0416cf3-27fc-3a50-a2f4-5bcdbd5e26b3",
                                "text": "Words come after words with little punctuation, and because the lines are short our eyes fall down the page, scanning, shifting, making sense of each as it follows or comes upon the next. Yet, rather than a rush of feelings, the lines are pensees: a flow that incites intellectually, not viscerally."
